  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tajikistan Strengthening Water and Irrigation Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Trust Fund objective is to co-finance the IDA supported Tajikistan Strengthening Water and Irrigation Management Project (the Project) (P175356). The specific objectives of the project are to: (i) strengthen capacity for water resources planning and irrigation management in Tajikistan and (ii) improve performance of selected irrigation schemes in the Vakhsh and Zarafshon river basins.</narrative>
  </description>
